  "description": "Variation of condition 5 (cycle parking) attached to planning permission 2019/3369 dated&nbsp; 26-11-2019&nbsp; for “ Erection of three storey rear extension at basement, ground and first floor levels; formation of second floor roof terrace; excavation of front lightwell and rear lightwell with glazed screening; erection of rear roof extension; elevational changes to include alterations to shopfront and demolition of existing rear extensions; changes to rear boundary walls to allow formation of rear entrance; landscaping to include front boundary treatment, waste storage and rear cycle parking; to facilitate the conversion into three self-contained dwellings\"&nbsp; The variation would remove on site cycle parking provision in lieu of on street cycle hangars.",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "In the absence of on-site cycle storage provision, the proposals would fail to provide safe and secure storage of bicycles for occupants and visitors contrary to Policies T2 (Healthy Streets) and T4 (Assessing and mitigating transport impacts) of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney Local Plan Policies LP41 (Livable Neighbourhoods) and LP42 (Walking and Cycling) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020)."
  ],
